t("Rogue", "Rogue", "birth descriptor name")
t("Rogues are masters of tricks; they can strike from the shadows, and lure monsters into deadly traps.", "Rogues are masters of tricks; they can strike from the shadows, and lure monsters into deadly traps.", "_t")
t("Rogues are masters of tricks. A Rogue can get behind you unnoticed and stab you in the back for tremendous damage.", "Rogues are masters of tricks. A Rogue can get behind you unnoticed and stab you in the back for tremendous damage.", "_t")
t("Rogues usually prefer to dual-wield daggers. They can also become trapping experts, detecting and disarming traps as well as setting them.", "Rogues usually prefer to dual-wield daggers. They can also become trapping experts, detecting and disarming traps as well as setting them.", "_t")
